    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"making a difference\" ... i don't know if i believe that anymore. i saw a kid tonight, maybe 7 or 8, and it just hit me that no matter how many times i do my job, the world just keeps producing more pain. it feels like my life is just being consumed by this... this constant, endless suffering. i'm just so incredibly drained. like, there's nothing left of me.",
